<section class="section" style="background: #fff;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 3.5rem; text-align: center;">
      <h2 class="section-title">Why choose a local DFW production studio?</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
        We believe that relying on untraceable overseas suppliers creates unnecessary risk for your brand. By keeping production local in Texas, we guarantee absolute quality, eliminate communication barriers, and deliver your bulk orders on demand, free from shipping delays.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; background: var(--color-cream); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-navy);">1. Local service & faster communication</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Direct answers from the team actually making your products.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; background: var(--color-cream); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-navy);">2. Full quality control in-house</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Every item is inspected before leaving our facility.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; background: var(--color-cream); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-navy);">3. Experienced technicians</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Trained professionals operating commercial-grade laser equipment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; background: var(--color-cream); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-navy);">4. Precision multi-material engraving</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Flawless execution across wood, metal, glass, and acrylic.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; background: var(--color-cream); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-navy);">5. Flexible volumes (10–5000+)</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Scaling effortlessly from small pilot batches to massive corporate runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; background: var(--color-cream); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-navy);">6. Better control than overseas</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Avoid hidden customs fees, huge delays, and untrackable shipments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Why Choose Us",
  "presets": [{"name": "Why Choose Us"}]
}
{% endschema %}
